        "description": {
            "value": "<p>A wave of purified salt burns away moisture and wickedness, dealing 5d4 acid damage. Each creature within the area must attempt a Fortitude save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage. If the creature has the ooze, unholy, or water trait, it also takes @Damage[(@item.level)d4[persistent,spirit]] damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, and double persistent damage if it has the ooze, unholy, or water trait.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The acid damage increases by 2d4, and the persistent damage on a failure increases by 1d4.</p>"
